WEBVTT

00:09:58.836 --> 00:10:02.436
by exploiting something
that is much bigger than ourselves,

00:10:02.476 --> 00:10:04.036
the forces of nature.

00:10:04.636 --> 00:10:06.876
If you ask the International
Energy Agency,

00:10:06.916 --> 00:10:10.236
they will tell you that offshore wind

00:10:10.236 --> 00:10:13.756
has the potential to cover
the current electricity demand

00:10:13.796 --> 00:10:16.276
of the entire world, not once,

00:10:16.316 --> 00:10:18.156
not twice,

00:10:18.196 --> 00:10:19.796
18 times.

00:10:21.556 --> 00:10:23.836
So when you go to Denmark,

00:10:23.876 --> 00:10:25.836
you’ll meet a Dane.

00:10:25.876 --> 00:10:29.516
After you have said something nice
about our football team,

00:10:29.516 --> 00:10:30.516
(Chuckles)